<Plain title="Contact" description="Contact Secure Mac App for corrections, press enquiries, or to request that your Mac app be listed in our comparisons." path="/contact/">
  <p>General questions and corrections: <a href="mailto:hello@securemacapp.com">hello@securemacapp.com</a></p>
  <p>Press and listing requests: <a href="mailto:press@securemacapp.com">press@securemacapp.com</a></p>

  <h2>Want your app listed?</h2>
  <p>We include apps when they are useful to Mac users and we can test them. Please send: the app name and link, what it does, platforms, price, whether it is open source, and a download or review copy. We don't sell placement. If an app is paid for or affiliated, we mark it.</p>

  <h2>Reporting a security issue in Secure Vault</h2>
  <p>Email <a href="mailto:hello@securemacapp.com">hello@securemacapp.com</a> with the subject "Security". We'll acknowledge it promptly.</p>
</Plain>
